            <div xml:id="m-b1e5a434-652c-4c57-ac52-a3564a9ee267">
              <lg xml:id="m-e0d9701a-6b57-4a7f-9021-9b1a3325cde6">
                <l xml:id="m-f6a82cc3-95a5-4513-a2cd-787b9be6347d" facs="#m-a903fb9f-fe78-4bd9-9cbf-495173f58b73" label="ambiguous">1290</l><l xml:id="m-13c83c30-acda-46f4-9d84-9bb9b38b542e" facs="#m-2a897435-22c0-496e-9d93-c0187d5175fa" label="text-like">Nuptiai Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-7d058b66-11c0-46b4-961f-be11ba6acf98" facs="#m-fec2e3e3-e840-4176-a362-136d00b5f9a3" label="text-like">After Septuagesima, the following Tract is said instead or the Alleltia. and</l><l xml:id="m-e83d0a54-f40e-4995-8a0d-cb115374e72b" facs="#m-8c97376e-1322-4732-b550-d9dc1e9733ae" label="ambiguous">its Verse:</l><l xml:id="m-f3f5868a-6631-4aa6-af25-eaea425461c7" facs="#m-a99bfbd6-a2f4-4547-b9a2-4c5ae291f48d" label="ambiguous">Tract.</l><l xml:id="m-97aed7b2-2458-4c8a-b087-1372b2099538" facs="#m-fd7c856c-1f00-49de-a79f-954bf0df8eed" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-06a57b3d-b808-4624-9761-80f83d8a3f50" facs="#m-72eff9a7-704a-41e5-9ee9-035d98052a1f" label="ambiguous">U Cce</l><l xml:id="m-37ded944-196f-4e88-bfaa-79ebdff3d28a" facs="#m-a4268c93-2ac4-4e31-9689-2d07f978043a" label="lyrics-like">sic be-ne-di-cé¬ tur ómnis</l><l xml:id="m-5954591e-c08a-409a-9dde-e29a4ed7819c" facs="#m-5e6cb120-8514-4d22-8b12-5f6701836b5e" label="ambiguous">V. Be¬</l><l xml:id="m-851cebdd-bf60-4175-8358-cfac2ed7ccbf" facs="#m-b722a220-69e1-4dd4-a7ea-4bd9217dee46" label="lyrics-like">hómo qui tí- met Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3d528cf1-365f-4e61-b00f-e0acbaa9beab" facs="#m-f0bad35a-93a5-4479-811d-56591c6ced00" label="lyrics-like">cat tí- bi Dóminus ex Si-on:</l><l xml:id="m-6a6c0398-ba5f-4b81-83ff-da45d42a3af9" facs="#m-4059c879-a23f-4f70-8242-e97178a51186" label="lyrics-like">nedí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9640635a-7fa6-4383-8ff9-b8feee899987" facs="#m-ebce741a-489a-445b-9f59-60d9b58174cc" label="lyrics-like">ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8cfa017-4a9d-4ce1-b7a0-760201788f8d" facs="#m-66e64b3a-6ec9-469f-b305-c541aefcf391" label="lyrics-like">et vi-de-as bóna Jerú¬ sa-lem</l><l xml:id="m-cc9af63c-07de-45bb-bd54-b3efe386c68a" facs="#m-f6bf3ff9-40d0-48b0-93d3-46056b1f9402" label="ambiguous">V. Et</l><l xml:id="m-e8590f3a-73a0-4894-b6ad-2ebe04c59b4f" facs="#m-4a5ec975-6523-4afc-bfbb-16d23691f2b1" label="lyrics-like">bus di-é- bus ví-tae tú-ae.</l><l xml:id="m-e0cd5756-2424-489f-8465-5e20ddf28c8a" facs="#m-94579442-6b4e-48bc-bbf9-d1a000d12e25" label="lyrics-like">fí-li- os fi-li-6́-rum tu¬</l><l xml:id="m-62753ab7-ce6f-49d5-bec6-6a6ff6126021" facs="#m-faf40253-0ef3-46d2-8910-545e0c8aee67" label="lyrics-like">ví- de-as</l><l xml:id="m-a6166d41-94e4-45ff-a221-ff08cc430035" facs="#m-079b9f82-9d3d-474d-9f2f-e0a5843899ba" label="lyrics-like">6́- rum:</l><l xml:id="m-69e3df59-69ea-4006-9c22-ff3a2d4d290c" facs="#m-52865b5a-06c0-49cf-99c6-d62d745aa305" label="ambiguous">pax super Isra-el.</l><l xml:id="m-3c3a6005-2fd2-4ab1-9994-10785e3b7bff" facs="#m-25d4a677-f680-466b-9e1a-10f0fcc175cb" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Allelúia, alleluia. Y. Mittat</l><l xml:id="m-fab5b780-86f6-4a06-9958-c29f8b357095" facs="#m-ff10c95d-a53f-4393-9122-88065aef8420" label="lyrics-like">vóbis. is sung instead, p. 1289; and then the following:</l><l xml:id="m-f7b13391-4a81-42b2-b9e7-11e91891c2d9" facs="#m-71737271-a19b-48db-a1d7-6371d0977b01" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-8a7628e2-b5a8-43f0-85f5-457d91a31a1a" facs="#m-c6a7418b-5a0e-4555-af90-ab42744224dd" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-24964cbb-b764-4def-89c7-179ff45d8d63" facs="#m-c4d877af-2891-43e1-9302-fadaa8f5d8b4" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-97b79955-a1e5-4996-abaf-17fcccac35f6" facs="#m-d75129f0-bb45-439b-b728-bf5d4af3db82" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-e114adff-f8ed-45ba-8d95-66cdb759a970" facs="#m-cdef9590-4ded-47b7-9079-7ba3c3ed214e" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-23c876ed-03ca-454e-b1a2-cab038d4e8e5" facs="#m-8ffcc16a-a853-4d6d-9961-d6d9f1941b6e" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3659cfd-cc6e-4d8a-b89e-9ca982803314" facs="#m-0aca3d3d-60fd-4889-a74e-18537321b9b2" label="lyrics-like">cat vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f9c3e75-5c8b-41fe-ad08-40643c6a2ab3" facs="#m-71375a81-d002-4941-be4a-b1fc3f386c88" label="ambiguous">bis</l></lg>
            </div>
